      <title>线上卖到60亿后，女装品牌为何还要重返线下开店</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%96%E5%88%B060%E4%BA%BF%E5%90%8E%E5%A5%B3%E8%A3%85%E5%93%81%E7%89%8C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E8%BF%98%E8%A6%81%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%94%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%E5%BC%80%E5%BA%97/</link>
